cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this record, please cite it as below."
title: "Forecast and audit record for the first enhanced-geothermal production history (Project Red, Nevada)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zemani
    given-names: Toni
abstract: >-
  One-command, standard-library reproduction of a conduction-model fit
  (0.51 deg F) to the Nevada regulator's monthly record of an enhanced
  geothermal well pair, its water balance (65.9 % of injected mass returned),
  a 33-row audit of public claims about it, and forecasts registered and
  time-stamped before the data exist. Failed campaigns are included.
keywords:
  - enhanced geothermal systems
  - thermal decline
  - registered forecast
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
